[I] Library to parse header files

[T] A pure python C++ header parser that parses C++ headers in a mildly naive
[T] manner that allows it to handle many C++ constructs, including many modern
[T] (C++11 and beyond) features. This is a complete rewrite of the
[T] CppHeaderParser library.

[U] https://pypi.org/project/cxxheaderparser/

